Comet Browser/Computer Artifact Reconstructor
Copyright 2026 Kyongho Gong, Jihun Joun

This product is the companion tool to the paper "Reconstructing Agentic AI
Behavior from Browser Artifacts: A Forensic Case Study of Perplexity Comet".

It depends at runtime on ccl_chromium_reader and ccl_simplesnappy
(CCL Solutions Group Ltd., https://github.com/cclgroupltd), which are
installed separately from source and carry their own licenses.
